{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">MD5-DIGEST function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":241,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310041","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/MD5-DIGEST-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/MD5-DIGEST-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"MD5-DIGEST-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">MD5-DIGEST function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MD5-DIGEST-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Hashes the specified data using the RSA Message Digest\nHash Algorithm (MD5), and returns a 16-byte binary message digest value\nas a RAW value.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MD5-DIGEST-function__syntax_GC18VP2696575\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d201360e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"MD5-DIGEST-function__idGDM2M62672521\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>MD5-DIGEST( <var class=\"keyword varname\">data-to-hash</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">hash-key</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">data-to-hash</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The source data to hash. The data may be of type CHARACTER, LONGCHAR,\nRAW, or MEMPTR. If the data is a CHARACTER or LONGCHAR value, the\nAVM converts it to UTF-8 (which ensures a consistent value regardless\nof code page settings). To avoid this automatic conversion, specify\na RAW or MEMPTR value.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">hash-key</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">An optional key value to use in the hash operation. The key\nmay be of type CHARACTER, LONGCHAR, RAW, or MEMPTR. If the key is a\nCHARACTER or LONGCHAR value, the AVM converts it to UTF-8 (which\nensures a consistent value regardless of code page settings). To avoid\nthis automatic conversion, specify a RAW or MEMPTR value. This key\nvalue is combined with the source data before the hash operation begins.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">If either <var class=\"keyword varname\">data-to-hash</var> or <var class=\"keyword varname\">hash-key</var> is the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), then the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>) is\n              returned from the function.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">If\nthe <var class=\"keyword varname\">hash-key</var> value contains a null character, the\nnull character is included in the hash operation. </p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MD5-DIGEST-function__see-also_GC18VQ2696586\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d201360e183\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MESSAGE-DIGEST-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MESSAGE-DIGEST-function.html\">MESSAGE-DIGEST function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SHA1-DIGEST-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SHA1-DIGEST-function.html#SHA1-DIGEST-function\">SHA1-DIGEST function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MAXIMUM-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MAXIMUM-function.html\">MAXIMUM function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MEMBER-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MEMBER-function.html\">MEMBER function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310041","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":241,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"MD5-DIGEST function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MD5-DIGEST-function.html","type":"Manual"}